      "content": "it's just that the \"fighting\" is what's killing me. everyone expects me to keep pushing, to keep being the leader, to keep performing. but i feel like i'm just waiting for a way out that doesn't involve another 14-hour workday or another year of this emptiness. do you think it's actually wrong to want that kind of permanent peace? to just want the noise to be gone for good?",
